===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|dominion|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|frm}} {{term|dominion|lang=frm}}, from {{etyl|ML.}} {{term|dominio}}, equiv. to {{etyl|la}} {{term|dominium||lordship, right of ownership}}, from {{term|dominus||lord}}, from {{term|domus||house}}.  See [[domain]], [[demain]], [[demesne]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-us-dominion.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# power or the use of power; [[sovereignty]] over something.
# a [[kingdom]], [[nation]], or other [[sphere of influence]].

